message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Atomic structural invariants of the standard genetic code: preprint, data, and code"
authors:
  - family-names: "Khafizov"
    given-names: "Ruslan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0498-1229"
abstract: >
  Code, data, and preprint accompanying the analysis of atomic
  structural invariants of the standard genetic code. The work
  studies the atomic composition (C, H, N, O, S) of the encoded
  amino acids across codon groups defined by family degeneracy and
  by third-position chemical axes, and identifies a three-dimensional
  space of linear invariants constant across the third-position
  groups. It is a companion to "Arithmetic structure of the standard
  genetic code", which analyses the same groups through nucleon
  counts and divisibility by 37. The repository contains the preprint
  (LaTeX source and PDF), input and computed datasets, and a
  reproducibility script.
keywords:
  - genetic code
  - amino acids
  - atomic composition
  - structural invariants
  - wobble position
  - codon degeneracy
